<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<Definitions xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <CubeBlocks>
    <Definition xsi:type="MyObjectBuilder_BatteryBlockDefinition">
      <Id>
        <TypeId>BatteryBlock</TypeId>
        <SubtypeId>ArcanePower_EnergyCore_Pillar</SubtypeId>
      </Id>
      <DisplayName>Arcane Energy Core</DisplayName>
      <Description>3x3x3 Energy Core storage controller.

INSTALLATION
Four upright 1x3x1 bays accept capacity, transfer or stabilizer modules.
Align module Up with core Up and face its connectors toward the core.

STORAGE AND TRANSFER
Base: 1,000 MWh capacity / 10 GW transfer.
Capacity modules add 10,000 or 100,000 MWh.
Transfer modules raise the bank ceiling to 100 GW / 1 TW.
Standard/advanced stabilizers support matching or lower tier modules.
Duplicate stabilizer/transfer modules use the strongest tier without stacking.

CHARGING
Native Auto / Recharge / Discharge modes.
Starts empty; 90% charge efficiency.
Emergency reactor support switches Recharge to Auto and leaves it in Auto.

RESERVE
Default: 10% emergency reserve. Configure in Custom Data:
[ArcaneEnergyCore]
ReservePercent=10
EmergencySupport=true

TERMINAL / TOOLBAR
Surge: charges affordable jump drives in 5 seconds at 90% efficiency.
Bank discharge increases with the selected batch.
Each additional drive adds 25% of the base recovery time.
Burst: double discharge for 10 seconds.
Both abilities share recovery and protect the reserve.

UPKEEP
Stored-charge loss rises with fill; stabilizers reduce loss.
Passive loss continues while disabled or detached.</Description>
      <Icon>Textures/GUI/Icons/ArcanePower/Energy/ArcanePower_EnergyCore_r0202a47df10c.dds</Icon>
      <CubeSize>Large</CubeSize>
      <BlockTopology>TriangleMesh</BlockTopology>
      <Model>Models/Cubes/large/energy_d104fb55c4a2/ArcanePower_EnergyCore.mwm</Model>
      <BlockPairName>ArcanePower_EnergyCore_Pillar</BlockPairName>
      <EdgeType>Light</EdgeType>
      <BuildTimeSeconds>180</BuildTimeSeconds>
      <PCU>100</PCU>
      <IsAirTight>false</IsAirTight>
      <Public>true</Public>
      <DamageEffectName>Damage_Electrical_Damaged</DamageEffectName>
      <DamagedSound>ParticleElectrical</DamagedSound>
      <DestroyEffect>BlockDestroyedExplosion_Large</DestroyEffect>
      <DestroySound>PoofExplosionCat3</DestroySound>
      <EmissiveColorPreset>Default</EmissiveColorPreset>
      <Size x="3" y="3" z="3" />
      <Center x="1" y="1" z="1" />
      <ModelOffset x="0" y="0" z="0" />
      <Components>
        <Component Subtype="SteelPlate" Count="1000" />
        <Component Subtype="Construction" Count="500" />
        <Component Subtype="PowerCell" Count="1200" />
        <Component Subtype="Superconductor" Count="1000" />
        <Component Subtype="Computer" Count="200" />
        <Component Subtype="Motor" Count="80" />
        <Component Subtype="SteelPlate" Count="200" />
      </Components>
      <CriticalComponent Subtype="Computer" Index="0" />
      <BuildProgressModels>
        <Model BuildPercentUpperBound="0.33" File="Models/Cubes/large/energy_d104fb55c4a2/ArcanePower_EnergyCore_BS1.mwm" />
        <Model BuildPercentUpperBound="0.67" File="Models/Cubes/large/energy_d104fb55c4a2/ArcanePower_EnergyCore_BS2.mwm" />
        <Model BuildPercentUpperBound="1.00" File="Models/Cubes/large/energy_d104fb55c4a2/ArcanePower_EnergyCore_BS3.mwm" />
      </BuildProgressModels>
      <MountPoints>
        <MountPoint Side="Front" StartX="0" StartY="0" EndX="3" EndY="3" />
        <MountPoint Side="Back" StartX="0" StartY="0" EndX="3" EndY="3" />
        <MountPoint Side="Left" StartX="0" StartY="0" EndX="3" EndY="3" />
        <MountPoint Side="Right" StartX="0" StartY="0" EndX="3" EndY="3" />
        <MountPoint Side="Top" StartX="0" StartY="0" EndX="3" EndY="3" />
        <MountPoint Side="Bottom" StartX="0" StartY="0" EndX="3" EndY="3" />
      </MountPoints>
      <ResourceSourceGroup>Battery</ResourceSourceGroup>
      <MaxPowerOutput>2000000</MaxPowerOutput>
      <ResourceSinkGroup>BatteryBlock</ResourceSinkGroup>
      <RequiredPowerInput>1000000</RequiredPowerInput>
      <AdaptibleInput>true</AdaptibleInput>
      <MaxStoredPower>1000</MaxStoredPower>
      <InitialStoredPowerRatio>0</InitialStoredPowerRatio>
      <RechargeMultiplier>0.9</RechargeMultiplier>
    </Definition>
    <Definition xsi:type="MyObjectBuilder_BatteryBlockDefinition">
