      <DisplayName>Arcane Capacity Module</DisplayName>
      <Description>Full 1x3x1 large-grid pillar.

INSTALLATION
Attach to any of the four Energy Core bays.
Align Up with core Up and face the connectors toward the core.
Requires a matching or stronger attached stabilizer.

STORAGE
Stores 10,000 MWh in this block.
Removal retains its charge; destruction loses it.
New, projected and copied blocks start empty.
The core sets bank transfer limits and charge mode.</Description>
